{"data": [{"author_id": "2343714594", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:22:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125943228155429202"], "id": "2125943228155429202", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2343714594", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125917705782112362", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "ClaudeもMeta Museの後追いしてるね。しかもMuseやGemini Taskが無料で使えるのに対してClaude Duetは有料。 #AI\n\n自律型AIエージェント「Claude Duet」、日本でも利用可能に - PC Watch https://t.co/rNOqUg5x8i", "url": "https://x.com/ckkinn/status/2125943228155429202"}, {"author_id": "41012361", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:17:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125941899949433018"], "id": "2125941899949433018", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "자연어·코드를 편집 가능한 https://t.co/A4kaCxhuc3 아키텍처 다이어그램으로 바꿔주는 스킬.\nhttps://t.co/Ezff3MG8mW\n다이어그램은 그리는 게 아니다. 말로 시키면 그려진다.\nby meta muse", "url": "https://x.com/hunykang/status/2125941899949433018"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2125878588431847424"]}, "author_id": "2102442534764953601", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125941391016837256"], "id": "2125941391016837256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🛒 BREAKING: AMAZON AND META COULD JOIN FORCES IN AI SHOPPING.\n\nAmazon $AMZN is reportedly considering allowing Meta’s $META Muse AI to shop directly on Amazon.\n\nThis could open the door to:\n\n• AI-powered product discovery\n• Automated shopping experiences\n• Higher e-commerce https://t.co/3UFWHabqzQ", "url": "https://x.com/BacklogAlpha/status/2125941391016837256"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125941218173452288"]}, "author_id": "245430943", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:14:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125941230034911441"], "id": "2125941230034911441", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Is it just me, or does the Meta Muse mascot look a bit like the Adipose monsters from Doctor Who?!! 😂😂 https://t.co/7E2EgkLuO2", "url": "https://x.com/R_ViewMovies/status/2125941230034911441"}, {"author_id": "1475232253458350082", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:14:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125941142076453225"], "id": "2125941142076453225", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1475232253458350082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125941141006876738", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Day 25. My Meta @Muse invite code is 4KV04O, add it in Settings. Day 26 tomorrow: facility and field requests.", "url": "https://x.com/anthonycoaches/status/2125941142076453225"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125940810810347520"]}, "author_id": "1475232253458350082", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125941138393837675"], "id": "2125941138393837675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Day 25: equipment and uniform orders. Gear ordered in a panic costs more and arrives late. My assistant, Meta Muse, keeps the order list current all winter so February is a check, not a scramble.\n\n#SoftballCoach #MetaMuse https://t.co/KFQ776LefY", "url": "https://x.com/anthonycoaches/status/2125941138393837675"}, {"author_id": "41012361", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:13:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125940968247685401"], "id": "2125940968247685401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "돈은 들어왔는데 채권은 그대로다. 반제가 끝나야 비로소 수금이 된다. https://t.co/aK0Klcxvt0\nby meta muse", "url": "https://x.com/hunykang/status/2125940968247685401"}, {"article": {"title": "Muse 的 IP 总乱跳？研究了一套固定住宅 IP 出口方案，让 Muse 拥有自己专属云电脑！附操作和 AI 提示词！"}, "author_id": "1004168615225012229", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:04:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125938826795524455"], "id": "2125938826795524455", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Muse 的 IP 总是乱跳？能不能让它使用独享静态住宅 IP 访问网页和客户端？\n\n研究了一套 Muse + Tailscale + 住宅 IP VPS 的技术方案，整理了部署流程、IP 检测方法，以及五组可直接复制的 AI 提示词。\n\n全局出口尚待实测，有 VPS 的兄弟可以用现有设备尝试，值得收藏研究。 https://t.co/4SadkJun5w", "url": "https://x.com/Leo_zhang2018/status/2125938826795524455"}, {"author_id": "2118502001180884992", "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:03:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125938460066541956"], "id": "2125938460066541956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When communication fails between artists and promoters, careers get trapped. Afrobeats Rap artist’s issues show why regulated infrastructure is needed to relay messages clearly, &amp; track marketing commitments. @PeckFoundation there to toll that bridge. Reps: contact iphc@muse.ai", "url": "https://x.com/PeckFoundation/status/2125938460066541956"}, {"author_id": "1937920099454943233", "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:59:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125937589995913717"], "id": "2125937589995913717", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1937920099454943233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125937254560661730", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The problem: bots like Grok Bot, Claude Duet, ChatGPT dots and Meta Muse write code line by line, on their own tokens. Meanwhile proven coding CLIs sit unused on the same machine.", "url": "https://x.com/jlcreddy17/status/2125937589995913717"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2125937493493293056"]}, "author_id": "1858345599290204160", "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:59:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125937564595134676"], "id": "2125937564595134676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "配乐在 2.4 秒有个鼓点。视频按 30 fps 渲染，转场就可以排在帧号 72。换一首歌，重新找鼓点、排帧号，再渲一版。\n\nJonny 分享了 20 个围绕 Meta Muse 做动效的 GitHub 项目。我想先拿其中几项做一条带旁白和配乐的产品演示片。\n\n先用 WhisperX 把文字和旁白对齐，拿到每个词的起止时间，再用 librosa https://t.co/wpbCgNWBia", "url": "https://x.com/ziwen_uu/status/2125937564595134676"}, {"article": {"title": "Only 7.7% of Ghana’s Businesses Are Formal as Deloitte Warns of Deep-Rooted Enterprise "}, "author_id": "1978909005662584832", "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:57:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125937059034534200"], "id": "2125937059034534200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/1z3lp30fuT", "url": "https://x.com/UphorialTech/status/2125937059034534200"}, {"article": {"title": "Richards Bay Terminal Makes Maritime History with Record Chrome Shipment to Singapore"}, "author_id": "1978909005662584832", "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:57:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125936989199270181"], "id": "2125936989199270181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 116, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Dfa7MHIidu", "url": "https://x.com/UphorialTech/status/2125936989199270181"}, {"article": {"title": "Dangote Refinery Shares to Begin Trading on the Nigerian Exchange on December 1"}, "author_id": "1978909005662584832", "created_at": "2026-11-26T12:57:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125936914851139731"], "id": "2125936